  _name: Janitor Victim
  Speaker: Janitor
  lines:
  - He was okay, but I personally did not like the way he acted around people.
  - 'Detective: Ooo, why is that?'
  - 'When he was in front of a big group of people, he made sure everyone liked him.
    But when he was alone with a small group of people he acted like a real jackass,
    he started hitting on every girl he saw, and he also drank a lot. '
  - I had to clear out his garbage bin three times in like three to four hours when
    he is here.
